ote\": \"U1 | MAX3485 (half-duplex RS-485/RS-422 transceiver) | Converts the M5Stack's UART (TXD2/RXD2, PortC) to the shared single-wire TTL serial servo bus.\"}], \"impact\": \"In serial mode the MAX3485 receives no transmit data on DI, so servo commands cannot be sent. The buffer output also contends with the M5Stack's TXD2 driver, which can corrupt the UART and the direction-control timing.\", \"confidence\": 0.6}], \"summary\": \"The board's serial-servo transmit path is broken: the MAX3485 DI input is left with no driver, and an unlisted 74LVC1G34 buffer's output is tied to the M5Stack TXD2 pin instead of its input. The remaining values and jumper/power connections match the specification.\"}",
